OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway partly reopens after
OL,4,Amajor crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M4 in Berkshire has
OL,7,Fpartly reopened after it was closed
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,10,FThe motorway was shut both ways between
OL,11,Fjunction 8/9 for Maidenhead and
OL,12,Fjunction 10 for Reading after a crash
OL,13,Fat about 21:00 BST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe eastbound carriageway reopened at
OL,16,Fabout 13:40. National Highways said it
OL,17,Fwas completing work on the westbound
OL,18,Fcarriageway and that will stay shut for
OL,19,Fthe time being.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
