OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway partly reopens after
OL,4,Amajor crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic heading west is being diverted
OL,7,Foff the motorway at junction 8/9.
OL,8,FDrivers are being warned to allow extra
OL,9,Ftime.
